# Line endings, decided here rather than by whichever machine last committed.
#
# The repository is written on Windows and the server scripts run on the
# school's Linux machine. A shell script checked out with CRLF fails there with
# `$'\r': command not found` — a confusing error a long way from its cause — so
# the two file types that care are pinned and everything else is normalised.

* text=auto

*.sh text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.xlsx binary
*.docx binary
